# Counsellor Shogo at the ruined house (CIPlay camp_blackwater_talk, 11-12 w14 prep; in a test world 'CI ...').
# He sits on a chair at -79 -8.5 (was Walt Pruitt, lean). Answer 1: the boathouse cellar in the journal. Answer 2: why he stays.
# Answer 3: shows the strongroom hatch (cbcellarhatch) with "Your funeral.". The quest's step 12 names him. Offline-written, never run.
island Camp Blackwater
offset -0.4374 -1.2402
hour 11
weather Calm
expect hidden cbcellarhatch
picture cb_islander -75.5 +2.4 -5 -79 +0.9 -8.5
use Counsellor Shogo pick 1
expect message long time before he answers
read The boathouse cellar
use Counsellor Shogo pick 2
expect message flare from the lookout
expect hidden cbcellarhatch
use Counsellor Shogo pick 3
expect message Your funeral
expect shown cbcellarhatch
